{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】立法會發展事務委員會今日(11月13日)舉行特別會議，討論瑪麗醫院臨床大樓升降機事故。另外，政府經濟顧問就第三季經濟表現及本地生產總值、物價預測舉行記者會。</p><p>採訪日誌｜立法會討論瑪麗醫院臨床大樓升降機事故／政府公布第三季經濟表現預測</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T23:44:22.707992+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:27:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T23:37:55.914797+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:37:55.914797+00:00","content_hash":"efbd672f00bf0be11a81035c5eb59fa99d7ea8425dcb90ede11caa7a02f33e20","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}